5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long rooms stay out of service during construction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff doing the upkeep are stretched thin. We must consider their workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Recent projects have slipped schedules. I want to see why the calendar keeps moving.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The final cost of a building rarely matches the initial budget. I want to see the numbers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, do you have data on how long rooms are closed?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, I am looking into the timetable records for rooms out of service.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, are the delays due to weather or planning?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I suspect both. I will check the site diaries for weather days.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the tender records to see if costs are rising.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the post-occupancy review ratings to see user satisfaction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the booking data to see how heavily the rooms are used.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will look at the staffing posts since the hiring freeze to see the gap.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the decade of delivery schedules to see the pattern.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the renewal reserve for equipment to see if we are underfunded.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
