35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The post-occupancy reviews show high ratings for shared spaces, low for single wings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Booking data confirms specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"Staffing posts are unfilled, but technicians have spare hours. We can reallocate.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Weather cost us six weeks. Projects for comfort slip, but inspection fixes are on time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs rose by a fifth. No reserve was set for replacing old AV kit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, does the booking data show which specific rooms are most in demand?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, general-purpose rooms are turned away all year. Specialist ones sit empty.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Benjamin, if mechanical costs are rising, does that affect the ventilation plan?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, if shared spaces rate higher, does that favor the study commons?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@George, the lack of a reserve means we are paying for old tech twice.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The data suggests we should prioritize spaces that serve many departments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. The study commons would address the demand for general rooms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I worry about the maintenance burden on the already thin staff.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The study commons is indoors, so weather delays are less of a risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The ventilation upgrade is expensive now, but the study commons is cheaper.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
