60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidates are A: Lab Ventilation, B: Study Commons, C: Path Network, D: Media Center.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"B seems to fit the booking data best. High demand, low current supply.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"C is outdoors. Weather delays are a risk, as Mizuki noted.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,B is indoors. It avoids the weather issues that plagued recent projects.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A is the most expensive due to rising mechanical costs. B is more budget-friendly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, do you think B will actually get used?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, the data shows general rooms are always full. B creates more of those.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, is B a quick project?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a conversion, not new build. Should be faster than the lab work.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"D is also a conversion, but the AV kit is old and needs replacing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B. It serves the most people and has good post-occupancy potential.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. B addresses the clear demand gap.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I am hesitant, but B is less risky than C. I will vote B.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,B avoids weather delays. I vote B.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,B is the most cost-effective. I vote B.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
